- safety rules

URL rule:
When a Perchance field contains an uploaded URL, add a simple Local path line below it.
Use:
Online =
Local =
Do not remove the original URL.

Pipe rule:
If a field uses |, treat it as a connected sub-field.
Example:
[General_Writing_Instructions]
Perchance_Field = 🪶 General writing instructions.
Sub_Field = 🪶 Define your custom writing:
Content = existing content

Vixella image rule:
Only connect an image to Vixella Rosepaw if:
- filename includes Vixella
- folder is AI/IMG/Vixella Rosepaw/
- .npc/.json references the image URL
- user explicitly says it belongs to Vixella

Otherwise, list it as [Unsorted_Character_Image_Asset].

