TASK 5: Perchance AI Artist image source rule.

Some WorldCore images were generated inside Perchance AI Character Chat using an AI artist character.

The image artist uses this format:
<image>description of image</image>

Do not remove these prompts if they appear in logs, JSON exports, or raw notes.
Treat them as image-generation source prompts.

Classify these as:
[Perchance_AI_Artist_Image_Source]

Fields:
Source = Perchance AI Character Chat
Generator_Type = AI artist character
Generation_Format = <image>...</image>
Prompt_Text = existing prompt if available
Generated_Image_File = [AI_FILL_LATER]
Character_Link = [AI_FILL_LATER]

If the generated image clearly belongs to a character, connect it to that character's Image_Asset_System.
If unclear, list it under [Unsorted_Character_Image_Asset].

Do not delete, rename, or move generated images unless explicitly told.